00:04:28.102 --> 00:04:29.537
aku harus sewa kurir lain.

00:04:30.605 --> 00:04:32.640
Tenang, beres.

00:04:36.677 --> 00:04:40.715
Sial. Licin sekali jalannya.

00:04:40.748 --> 00:04:41.916
<i>Apa?</i>

00:04:41.949 --> 00:04:44.652
Maaf, aku cuma bicara sendiri.

00:04:44.685 --> 00:04:45.820
<i>Bisa tolong bicara denganku?</i>

00:04:45.853 --> 00:04:47.454
<i>Aku menanyaimu sesuatu.</i>

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:49.957
Ya, aku tahu. Aku sedang berpikir.

00:04:51.092 --> 00:04:52.627
Menurutku...

00:04:54.028 --> 00:04:56.798
Menurutku itu tubuhmu,
dan itu pilihanmu.

00:04:57.799 --> 00:04:59.000
