dalam lima menit

01:20:37.371 --> 01:20:38.906
untuk menemui Garda Nasional.
Cepat.

01:20:38.939 --> 01:20:40.908
-Bagus?
-Membuka segel utama.

01:20:40.941 --> 01:20:43.578
Teman-teman,
kenapa dia di sini?

01:20:43.611 --> 01:20:45.479
Zat pengikat di suhu -80 °C.

01:20:45.513 --> 01:20:47.549
Semoga ibuku menonton
saat wartawan datang,

01:20:47.582 --> 01:20:49.584
karena dia pasti takjub.

01:20:49.617 --> 01:20:50.984
Tempat inilah

01:20:51.018 --> 01:20:52.419
awal mula semua ini, 'kan?

01:20:52.453 --> 01:20:54.221
Bukankah kalian yang membuat...

01:20:54.254 --> 01:20:55.889
Serius, kenapa dia
masih di sini?

01:20:55.923 --> 01:20:56.624
Ayolah!

01:20:56.658 --> 01:20:57.891
-Kau baik-baik saja?
-Ya.

01:20:57.925 --> 01:21:00.027
Ya.

01:21:00.060 --> 01:21:02.162
Cuma hari yang berat.
Banyak tangga.

01:21:02.196 --> 01:21:03.964
Hei, berapa lama

01:21:03.997 --> 01:21:05.966
sampai benda itu
jadi obatnya?

01:21:05.999 --> 01:21:08.502
Basanya siap.
Birdie, bagaimana?

01:21:08.536 --> 01:21:10.237
85%. Hampir selesai.

01:21:10.270 --> 01:21:12.106
Stanley, zat pengikatnya siap?

01:21:12.139 --> 01:21:15.008
Zat pengikat, siap...

01:21:15.577 --> 01:21:16.611
Sekarang.

01:21:16.644 --> 01:21:17.945
Bagus, Stanley.

01:21:22.149 --> 01:21:23.250
Oke, kuoper.

01:21:23.283 --> 01:21:26.286
Jangan sampai jatuh.
Hati-hati.

01:21:26.320 --> 01:21:27.589
Cepat.

01:21:28.690 --> 01:21:31.458
-Wade, bagaimana?
-Oke.

01:21:31.492 --> 01:21:35.630
Aman.

01:21:35.663 --> 01:21:38.966
-Sudah siap?
-Sedang berlipat ganda.

01:21:38.999 --> 01:21:40.467
-Dapat?
-Dave, ayo ekstraksi.

01:21:40.501 --> 01:21:43.003
Dimengerti. Mengekstraksi.

01:21:48.308 --> 01:21:50.612
-Astaga.
-Boleh aku

01:21:50.645 --> 01:21:51.979
minta sedikit?

01:21:52.012 --> 01:21:54.047
Astaga... Hei! Mundur!

01:21:54.081 --> 01:21:55.449
Dia terinfeksi!

01:21:55.482 --> 01:21:57.184
Aku masih baik-baik saja.

01:21:57.217 --> 01:21:58.318
Tangganya banyak sekali.

01:21:58.352 --> 01:22:00.320
Tapi aku sangat ingin
sedikit obat itu.

01:22:00.354 --> 01:22:02.690
Pak, Anda harus
keluar dari lab sekarang!

01:22:04.024 --> 01:22:05.392
Aduh!

01:22:05.426 --> 01:22:06.393
Aku tak akan menyakiti siapa pun.

01:22:06.427 --> 01:22:07.662
-Aku cuma...
-Dave, cepat!

01:22:07.695 --> 01:22:09.430
-Mundur!
-Sial, tak bisa kuambil.

01:22:09.463 --> 01:22:12.166
Menjauh!

01:22:24.344 --> 01:22:25.747
Dapat.

01:22:25.780 --> 01:22:26.980
Dapat!

01:22:37.191 --> 01:22:38.693
-Tidak!
-Sial!

01:22:45.633 --> 01:22:47.702
Wade, ambil suntikannya.

01:22:47.735 --> 01:22:50.070
-Apa?
-Ambil suntikannya.

01:23:13.393 --> 01:23:14.394
Dapat.

01:23:15.295 --> 01:23:16.296
Dapat!

01:23:19.233 --> 01:23:21.736
Tidak!

01:23:22.369 --> 01:23:23.805
Birdie! Birdie!

01:23:23.838 --> 01:23:26.173
-Tolong aku!
-Selamatkan dia!

01:23:26.206 --> 01:23:27.474
Birdie! Birdie! Birdie!

01:23:27.509 --> 01:23:29.611
Tolong.

01:23:30.745 --> 01:23:32.747
Birdie! Birdie!

01:23:32.780 --> 01:23:35.482
Birdie!

01:23:37.752 --> 01:23:39.052
Tidak!

01:23:42.256 --> 01:23:44.759
-Astaga.
-Ambil.

01:23:46.093 --> 01:23:47.394
Oke!

01:23:49.531 --> 01:23:51.231
-Ayo, Stanley.
-Oke.

01:23:51.265 --> 01:23:53.200
Ayo. Ya.

01:23:53.233 --> 01:23:55.235
Kau harus mencarinya.

01:23:55.269 --> 01:23:57.371
Gampang. Ambil saja

01:23:57.404 --> 01:23:58.640
