01:25:05.873 --> 01:25:08.342
Sial!

01:25:15.382 --> 01:25:17.250
Tunggu! Berhenti!

01:25:20.454 --> 01:25:21.856
Jangan!

01:25:36.571 --> 01:25:38.438
Jarumnya.

01:25:38.472 --> 01:25:40.173
Suntik aku.

01:25:42.409 --> 01:25:43.410
